# Council / daily news — monolingual trilingual

## Required for every publish
- Generate **separate** EN, UR, and AR for titles and body. Store EN in WordPress `content`; put UR/AR in post meta (`_dwf_nn_title_ur/_ar`, `_dwf_nn_body_ur/_ar`) when tagging frontline (`_dwf_nn_generated`).
- Never publish bilingual stacked HTML (no EN paragraph + Urdu companion in the same post body).
- Site displays only `?lang=` — BBC/CNN style.

## Contact footer
- English-only footer in stored HTML (MU injects monolingual contact by lang).
- Digits always Latin: `0300 087 4232` / `0345 825 4232` — never ۰۳۰۰ / ۰۳۴۵.
- Roles: 0300 = AI WhatsApp (no diagnosis; lab brief only; no imaging). 0345 = emergency direct.

## Buttons / CTAs
- Single-language labels only.
